 src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252500/extras/build-arrangel.gif?t=1729463656\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Remote control your mining cart</strong> to collect ore</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252500/extras/remote_control_cartl.gif?t=1729463656\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade buildings and weapons during a playthrough</strong> to kill, mine and produce even more effectively.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252500/extras/upgradesl.gif?t=1729463656\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Briefing from <strong>Sergeant</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252500/extras/General.gif?t=1729463656\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Alright, you slimy space worms! Listen up! I ain't here to hold your hand through the cosmos! You've been drafted into the ranks of the best intergalactic mining troop, a <strong>spaceman</strong>. Your sorry selves have been <strong>shipped off to some godforsaken planet to extract resources.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now, here's the deal: seems like the only thing worth a darn on this rock is the local critters. Yeah, you heard me right! Those squirming, scuttling creatures are the key . <strong>Your job? Round 'em up and toss 'em into the melting pot to keeping the lights on for our families back home.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No time for morals, this is survival! Get out there and get it done, because in space, it's them or us. Move out, spaceman!&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Missing Features</h2><p class=\"bb_p